      "english": "Off Course"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "“There are these four ways of going off course. Which four? One goes off course through desire. One goes off course through aversion. One goes off course through delusion. One goes off course through fear. These are the four ways of going off course.”"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "If you—"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "through desire,"
