      "number": 8,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "fear—"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "transgress the Dhamma,"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "your honor wanes,"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "as in the dark fortnight,"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "the moon."
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "“There are these four ways of not going off course. Which four? One doesn’t go off course through desire. One doesn’t go off course through aversion. One doesn’t go off course through delusion. One doesn’t go off course through fear. These are the four ways of not going off course.”"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "If you don’t—"
